    <description>Company Name(ENG) or Country 가 변경된 경우, Account Name 재설정
Insured Type 선택목록값에 따라 일반(계약자), 보험사, 재보험사, 중개사, MGA 여부 를 설정</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_InsurerAcc</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>INCLUDES({!$Record.InsuredType__c}, &quot;Insurer&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_ReinsurerAcc</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>INCLUDES({!$Record.InsuredType__c}, &quot;Reinsurer&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fm_UpdateAccountName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;[&quot;&amp;Text({!$Record.Country__c})&amp;&quot;]&quot;&amp;{!$Record.CompanyNameEng__c}</expression>
    </formulas>
